From d5632b37d86169c604fdd3c741955ea4213e43aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mahesh R Vaidya <mahesh.r.vaidya@intel.com>
Date: Thu, 8 May 2025 02:27:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] SM TSN Config-3 code changes

    1. Add mrphy driver support.
    2. Integrate mrphy driver with XGMAC socfpga driver.
    3. Add sysfs for reading the mrphy's efifo and soft pcs latency.
    4. Add sysfs to write to the xgmac's ingress and egress registers.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Mahesh R Vaidya <mahesh.r.vaidya@intel.com>
Signed-off-by: Vaidya, Mahesh R <mahesh.r.vaidya@intel.com>
